        {
          "text": "“Naishile ubwamba ukufuma munda muli mayo, kabili nkabwelelamo ubwamba uko nafumine. Yawe alipeele kabili Yawe napoka, nalipaalwe na matotelo ishina lyakwa Yawe.”",
